# The build reads the Dockerfile and the files it copies. Everything
# else here is documentation, checks, and configuration. Docker leaves
# it out of the build context, and so the recipe hash leaves it out,
# and a change to it needs no new revision.
README.md
LICENSE
package.toml
.pre-commit-config.yaml
smoke/
# The layout module's own check runs weston and test clients on a
# workstation, outside the image.
layout/smoke.sh
layout/smoke_client.py
